% A goal whose *type* is self-referential must not hang the checker.
%
% `[X | X]` types X's slot as alpha and, through the list
% constructor, as list(alpha) — a type with no finite solution. The
% occurs check on tc_unify's binding rules drops the fact instead of
% building the cyclic term: X's slot is flexible, so the accepting
% disposition is to leave it alone, and the goal runs.
%
% The sibling shape in a rule head goes through eq_unify, whose own
% occurs check landed with the guard-evidence work; this one is the
% expression/goal path, which reaches tc_unify via constructor_match.

:- module(typecheck_cyclic_expression, [p/1]).

:- chr_constraint p(any).
